            "review_title": "Review at Dau Do Cafe",
            "review_text": "Minh Tuan P\nDa Nang, Vietnam183 contributions\n0\nGood food but poor decoration\nMar 2017 • Friends\nWe came over just to take a look at the new coffee shop. \nThe decoration is a real mess. The space is small but they tried to put huge furniture inside. it was a big mistake, should something simple. \nThe foods, on the contrary, was actually good. We ordered club sandwich and binsu. Sandwich was a bit salty but adding some spicy taste made it turned out to be a nice dish. added some fried slice chips. Binsu was sweat and tasty as well. The rate is reasonable. We will come back for another meal.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 25, 2017",
